  "description": "The Trig has been a firm favourite for a massively diverse group of riders. We have seen them fully loaded for multi-day adventures, shod with slicks as an urban commuter, or just ridden stock for local lockdown sanity missions.\nThe Trig frameset features a 44mm headtube, multiple bottle cage mounts and tyre clearance to run any 700 or 650 gravel tyre option you want (and up 2.1” wide MTB tyres on 27.5” wheels). Want to get a little rowdier with your drop-bar endeavours? It’s even dropper post compatible for future off-road biased upgrades.\nThe frame is engineered from custom triple butted 4130 Chromoly steel tubing resulting in a frame that is lightweight and supple enough to provide comfort on longer trail rides whilst robust and stiff enough to take some serious abuse. The carbon fork features a 12mm thru axle and the mounting points you need to take to the backcountry.\nWe’re not going to pigeonhole the trig as gravel or adventure anymore. It’s all the same thing. We just made a super fun and reliable bike for you to go find your own adventure.",
